# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  PROJECT ROOT GUARD
#
#  The intended deployment points the document root at public/, in which case
#  Apache never reads this file. It exists for the OTHER common layout — the
#  project dropped into htdocs and reached at
#  http://localhost/ramson-portfolio/public — where the document root sits
#  ABOVE the project and every file here is otherwise served.
#
#  Verified on Apache 2.4.58: without this file, /ramson-portfolio/.git/config
#  returned 200 and served the repository configuration. .git exposure leaks
#  the entire source history, so this is denied at the root and re-granted
#  only inside public/ (see public/.htaccess).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Require all denied
Options -Indexes -MultiViews
